    {
      "id": "out-of-sight",
      "cardSha256": "ad43d29ddd9a989bd30953abbf620a93e866ec9bbc566906e696b115fd348dae",
      "side": "german",
      "name": "Out of sight",
      "idea": "The two wing platoons start where no Russian setup Location has a LOS to them, F6 and L7, so they are whole after the first Russian Prep Fire and meet the Russians inside their own buildings; the K5 platoon fires across the Guards' street from J4 and J5.",
      "givesUp": "The Russians cross to F5, G6, H5, L6, and M7 without fire from the platoons that own them; three squads in one hex are one target once they are seen.",
      "terrain": [
        "F6 has no LOS to or from any Russian setup Location, at any level; it sees E6, F7, and G7 at range 1 and D5, D6, E5, and H6 at 2.",
        "L7 at ground level has no LOS to or from any Russian setup Location; it sees L8 and M8 at range 1 and K6 and N7 at 2.",
        "J4 sees H4 at range 2, G5 at 3, and F4 at 4. J5 sees H4 at range 2 and F4 at 4, and is seen from G4 at range 3, from the upper levels of G3 and from N5 at 4, and from E4 at 5.",
        "K5 sees L4, L5, and K6 at range 1 and M6 at 2; it is seen from M5 at range 2, the upper levels of N3 at 3, and M2 at 4.",
        "I7 and M9 are one-hex stone buildings with a ground level only; F5, K5, and M7 have levels 1 and 2, reached by the stairwells in F6, J5, K4, and L6."
      ],
